[{"title":"雪后","author":"钱尔登","text":"高阁浩以洁，此心应自知。\n林花妆缟袂，鸟语噤冰枝。\n拨火灰宁死，愁风鬓欲丝。\n乾坤多缺陷，压覆正堪悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21095,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访僧田舍","author":"钱月龄","text":"北里寻僧舍，青山隔水田。\n扁舟孤墅入，红树碧溪连。\n菰米炊香积，茅茨带夕烟。\n相留无限意，我亦爱逃禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21096,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"澄江登君山","author":"钱月龄","text":"洞庭高耸翠，此亦重留名。\n太古苍茫色，长江昼夜声。\n暮烟横北固，晓日近东瀛。\n玄武昭灵胜，行宫焕紫清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21097,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏即景","author":"钱月龄","text":"衰微吟思健，户牖自南薰。\n散发惟高枕，清歌绕白云。\n课分蜂臼密，香□燕巢芹。\n不暇探幽赏，满庭空绿筠。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21098,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜井访僧","author":"钱月龄","text":"曲曲桑麻路，层层紫翠台。\n远寻铜井去，先访竹门开。\n云筥采茶入，瓦罂沽酒回。\n三生不尽话，松日照苍苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21099,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮槎自况","author":"钱月龄","text":"欲寻仙岛胜，故作此浮槎。\n风外青帆捷，烟中白鸟斜。\n沧洲夜吟月，阆苑晓看花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21100,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华发天随子，清波到处家飞来峰","author":"钱月龄","text":"此峰西竺有，何代远飞来。\n空洞玲珑窍，天香紫翠台。\n金鳌涌地出，灵鹫倚天开。\n奇胜复奇过，跻攀得几回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21101,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甘露寺","author":"钱月龄","text":"弭棹东溪步，寻诗北固游。\n大江空有月，多景已无楼。\n秋草埋香积，黄芦覆故洲。\n不堪南入望，吴晋两荒丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21102,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对酒口占","author":"钱月龄","text":"把盏临窗树，惊心叶半黄。\n有愁消腊醑，无计避秋霜。\n浮世蜗粘壳，劳生蚁战场。\n生涯从烂醉，拂石卧残阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21103,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和泉翁邵尚书点易台二首 其一","author":"钱月龄","text":"绣岭萦回抱此台，风云长为绕崔巍。\n侵衣月白疏松漏，洗砚泉香古涧来。\n尼父象文随化著，羲皇爻画自心开。\n六虚行尽天机健，数片梅花点翠苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21104,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和泉翁邵尚书点易台二首 其二","author":"钱月龄","text":"古今灵异此山川，远海高丘一望前。\n煦煦阳和随意领，玄玄太极妙心传。\n松阴三尺焚香石，花底千寻滴露泉。\n何处道人来倚杖，海天亭畔和瑶篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21105,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龚守诚社长水北山庄作会","author":"钱月龄","text":"好事常开水北堂，柳阴曲曲两三行。\n时来唤渡投吟社，每共看山坐石床。\n乌角风情归锦里，黄花篱落傲柴桑。\n咏歌半是投簪客，韦布相辉锦绣裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21106,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乡村访友","author":"钱月龄","text":"乱鸦枯木夕阳村，野客寻诗远到门。\n石径逗烟茶正熟，地炉连榻酒重温。\n寒泉写意琴三尺，午夜论心月半痕。\n一别忽经三十载，喜君生子又生孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21107,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日","author":"钱月龄","text":"群阴剥尽见天开，一脉阳和地底回。\n已见闭关敦古礼，又从嘘管试飞灰。\n饱飧不自知年歉，喜节还应畏老莱。\n改岁春风知不远，故将消息问寒梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21108,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吟仙阁初成志喜","author":"钱月龄","text":"碧树遥连海上峰，朗吟仙子旧相逢。\n银潢倒影天街近，玉屑浮香露气浓。\n一笛落梅飞逸响，五弦流水寄遐踪。\n钩帘独倚西阑暮，云在青山鹤在松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21109,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢近思惠紫霞冠","author":"钱月龄","text":"玉人遗我紫霞冠，似得明珠掌上看。\n云匣深藏灵气满，星坛高戴步虚寒。\n雅观近傍三花树，得意初成九转丹。\n从此不羞华发短，行歌尘外想飞翰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21110,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜","author":"钱月龄","text":"幽夜虚斋榾柮炉，香茶美酒向谁呼。\n岁将穷处春将复，人到贫时事到无。\n书卷自翻风叶乱，灯花细剔雨帘孤。\n丝丝一种清愁发，掩映寒梅野雀图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21111,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋","author":"钱月龄","text":"桂魄风清散夜氛，人间秋色正平分。\n九华炼液金承露，五彩浮空锦作云。\n脱蚌明珠从海出，侑觞仙乐自天闻。\n广寒咫尺邻虚阁，蹑景惭无象纬文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21112,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋分日同友人山行","author":"钱月龄","text":"羁愁暂摆作山行，秋日平分气转清。\n溪影照人风已息，稻香沾袖雨初晴。\n古今在眼青山色，岁序惊心白雁声。\n更喜同游俱物表，搴芝坐石看云生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21113,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六十自寿","author":"钱月龄","text":"忽忽年华六十来，无为化里此胚胎。\n烟霞古洞新吟阁，星月寒江旧钓台。\n香雨细看抽草带，东风先为破梅腮。\n一瓢分取泉中月，聊为饥年作寿杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21114,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游致道观","author":"钱月龄","text":"拂衣重上老君坛，廿载流光指一弹。\n星桧倒悬台上石，月泉香浴井中丹。\n云龙归洞灵湫黑，露鹤翻巢碧树寒。\n为觅旧游今已矣，临风搔首起长叹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21115,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿藏自赋","author":"钱月龄","text":"倏忽年来卦气周，黄芽未熟雪盈头。\n了心颇定归藏计，毕世终同造物游。\n日上松梢开绣岭，月明海外是瀛洲。\n从今不挂尘中念，好待空悬黍米浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21116,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"钱月龄","text":"城头霜落夜初分，呖呖悲鸿枕上闻。\n塞北未全收战马，江东漫自起愁云。\n惊心落叶敲窗雨，转眼流光过隙曛。\n寒梦易醒人易老，吟怀牢落岂堪云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21117,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同堠山宗侄重游张公洞","author":"钱月龄","text":"洞口四时花木鲜，探奇还入洞中天。\n丹留宿火仙家灶，芝秀灵根石上田。\n霹雳何年开此窍，跻攀今日付清缘。\n阿咸亦是高情者，蔬笋行庖几杖边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21118,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访吴竹沙隐君和王如山韵","author":"钱月龄","text":"萝屋寻君岂偶缘，閒情翠竹白沙前。\n拂衣松径沾清露，曳杖苔阶损绿钱。\n圮上再逢黄石老，山中又见紫芝仙。\n春畦过雨多栽药，甘苦尝来为引年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21119,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"华藏重游","author":"钱月龄","text":"秋水微茫秋日清，重寻烟寺荡舟轻。\n偈留法界云端月，果摘香台树杪橙。\n露气千崖浮沆瀣，潭光一镜湛空明。\n独山门外湖波杳，无限青山白鸟情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21120,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重九节登西山","author":"钱月龄","text":"振袂东山最上峰，道心物意两冲容。\n五湖天外陶朱宅，九日花前靖节筇。\n绀带枫林凝夕霁，甘流橙橘剖霜封。\n兴阑归棹鸥波阔，渡口夕阳帆影重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21121,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀三首 其一","author":"钱月龄","text":"浪游玄圃自年年，未信霜华到鬓边。\n天造流行何足计，世途高下漫随缘。\n风牵庭叶蛛丝乱，露洗盆花鹤顶妍。\n感兴有诗还感物，一回开落一凄然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21122,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀三首 其二","author":"钱月龄","text":"西邻僧舍白云重，梦枕惊回破晓钟。\n身寄百年犹过客，老添来日渐消容。\n江云排起沙头雁，露砌吟馀草际蛩。\n好事山人愁不寐，起将和露看青松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21123,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀三首 其三","author":"钱月龄","text":"露砌幽花抽玉簪，娟娟净对道人心。\n纤埃何有侵虚室，破壁惟应挂素琴。\n鹿饮频来窥涧满，鸦飞不断绕岩深。\n莫将此意闻朝市，恐解尘缨到远林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21124,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"钱月龄","text":"天澹鸟飞飞，山青云杳杳。\n道人默坐时，楼阁空中小。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21125,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岩居即事","author":"钱月龄","text":"未得餐云吸紫霞，饥来一任采山花。\n懵腾不识人间事，流水声中寄岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21126,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石塘庵夜宿","author":"钱月龄","text":"石塘春水浸渔矶，烟暮寻僧未掩扉。\n野话清灯照无睡，影堂沉寂篆烟微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21127,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"涌金亭纪胜","author":"钱月龄","text":"青巾一幅胜乌纱，径里香泥践落花。\n盘礴午凉亭树畔，瓦罂分汲煮春芽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21128,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十想诗十首 其一 河豚","author":"强仕","text":"春城灯事动，河豚首登俎。\n身远阖闾城，梦绕西施乳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21129,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十想诗十首 其二 蛤蜊","author":"强仕","text":"蛤蜊称海错，金胎裹银壳。\n若士海上游，食此翔廖廓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21130,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十想诗十首 其三 江鲚","author":"强仕","text":"江鲚色如银，大者乃兼尺。\n雕盘荐腹腴，一饱千金直。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21131,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十想诗十首 其四 樱桃","author":"强仕","text":"子美食樱桃，题诗叹转蓬。\n空怜点唇绛，尽作滴阶红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21132,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十想诗十首 其五 枇杷","author":"强仕","text":"枇杷夏中熟，金弹怜多摘。\n词邦仅有之，空存皮与核。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21133,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十想诗十首 其六 杨梅","author":"强仕","text":"五月熟杨梅，匀圆如火齐。\n说似西江人，口角流清泚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21134,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十想诗十首 其七 江鱼","author":"强仕","text":"白鲞即黄鱼，鱼味过于鲞。\n见鲞不见鱼，空作并州想。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21135,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十想诗十首 其八 鲥鱼","author":"强仕","text":"鲥鱼信多骨，鲜味此独出。\n子固不能诗，文名应不没。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21136,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十想诗十首 其九 银鱼","author":"强仕","text":"银鱼笠泽生，小白无乃是。\n季鹰思莼鲈，此味未应弃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21137,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十想诗十首 其十 螃蟹","author":"强仕","text":"左手持酒杯，右手无蟹螯。\n谁云宦游乐，秋来倍寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21138,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏梁鸿","author":"强仕","text":"伯鸾古贤人，乃在杵臼闲。\n夫妇共守志，逃名入深山。\n举案每齐眉，睢鸠两关关。\n凄凉五噫歌，东出辞帝阛。\n齐鲁复荆吴，长住遂不还。\n为佣岂无劳，顾己少外患。\n终葬烈士旁，高风邈难攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21139,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏向长","author":"强仕","text":"子平谢累辟，雅志在隐居。\n乏食或有馈，取足反其馀。\n读易深自悟，人世等蘧庐。\n谓贫富不及，谓贱贵不如。\n敕言婚嫁毕，家事毋关余。\n同好有禽生，肆意相与娱。\n五岳游躅遍，高风映简书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21140,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏王霸","author":"强仕","text":"儒仲有清节，始亦赴徵命。\n造廷抗高辞，不肯臣万乘。\n归来事躬耕，蓬藋掩门径。\n翩翩故人子，相过容服盛。\n一念儿曹羞，客去卧不应。\n赖有贤妇言，不失初守正。\n嘉遁遂终身，清辉两相映。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21141,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧山社会次俞是堂韵二首 其一","author":"强仕","text":"雪泥踪迹动经年，重捧芝函意恻然。\n宿德久悬丹陛望，闲心欲伴碧山禅。\n嗣音正羡空桑奏，为国时搜下泽贤。\n问俗画熊来早暮，水沉一炷石楼烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21142,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧山社会次俞是堂韵二首 其二","author":"强仕","text":"微官晚岁只虚名，旧学清时足隽声。\n偶向月中聊桂籍，欲从天汉拂尘缨。\n菲葑下采知同味，桑梓难忘自有情。\n白首郎瞻黑头相，可能冷落断金盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21143,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邹士则西爽轩","author":"强怡","text":"汲井事晨盥，华轩肃且清。\n敞扉面西麓，众峰何峥嵘。\n岩岫落棂牖，云霞集檐楹。\n鲜飙天际来，轻岚席上生。\n灏气薄琴册，余润沾緌樱。\n逍遥适意志，因之怡遁情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21144,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词","author":"茹宏","text":"妾心如水不流西，郎向萧关意莫疑。\n肯学杨花无定性，随风飞去便沾泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21145,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扊扅歌","author":"茹湜","text":"昔日与君相别时，炊扊扅兮烹伏雌。\n妾为浣妇君作相，妾歌扊扅君不向。\n君今富贵忘贱贫，五羊之皮何足珍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21146,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨白花","author":"茹湜","text":"杨白花，身轻不由已。\n一夕长风生，飘飘度江水。\n江南处处好繁华，悠扬落地知谁家。\n知谁家，不复归，永巷春深人迹稀。\n悲歌连臂空肠断，回首长秋鸦乱飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21147,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"孙源文","text":"软舞当筵叠鼓挝，盈盈翠幄总仙家。\n日斜歌罢行人去，零落东风荠菜花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21148,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"睡起","author":"孙源文","text":"颠毫枕老辟斜羞，一醒惟堪与醉谋。\n身世倒悬蜂宇宙，生涯虚寄燕春秋。\n名消无计占残纸，骨在相亲只敝裘。\n满眼东风吹绿遍，谁同花鸟解忘忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21149,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登司马墩","author":"邵芸","text":"司马今何在，乘风豁大观。\n霜林千树赤，星野万家寒。\n古道多榛棘，青霄几羽翰。\n君亲恩罔极，北望泪汍澜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21150,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至日舟居","author":"邵子才","text":"至日常为客，舟居是此年。\n冰坚寒乞火，风入夜装棉。\n梅信冲残腊，彤云布九天。\n兰陵堪贳酒，遥望隔溪烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21151,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送程生掾奔牛","author":"邵子才","text":"送子登程去，光阴正暮冬。\n雪消官道暖，云护野山重。\n公馆昼常静，河阳花更浓。\n莫嗟鸾凤翼，枳棘暂栖踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21152,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠山泉用坡公韵","author":"邵名世","text":"名泉天所钟，能浣诗人腹。\n大哉乾坤内，支派凡几族。\n剑池与龙池，渟泓石潭蓄。\n中泠逼建业，大江波相续。\n谷帘音清壮，如击渐离筑。\n盘纡虾蟆口，郁若蛟螭蹙。\n第二名兹泉，特以谤语渎。\n试步漪澜堂，箬裹圻新绿。\n数椀通仙灵，至味胜飧玉。\n众泉胥朝宗，俯首甘臣仆。\n圆池郭若盆，玩之才一掬。\n岂知千古人，齿颊余芳馥。\n天随玉川徒，游屐山中熟。\n诗肠瀹灵源，泱漭流万斛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21153,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶登凤谷行窝振衣亭","author":"施阳得","text":"斗室立四壁，山光未肯来。\n三秋忽有思，今日一登台。\n东海袖中出，西神杖底开。\n临风吾欲醉，呼月为相陪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21154,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小椿永恨歌","author":"施教","text":"人言萱草忧可忘，我见萱花忧倍结。\n前日见之广陵堂，使我踌躇生彷徨。\n追思孝宗十一年，此日何日风何颠。\n沙飞石走人事变，摧我庭椿不少延。\n小椿幸托萱花边，萱花覆荫尤多年。\n虽然寒暑更相易，炎风烈日无颠连。\n小椿虽渐长，未遇阳和天。\n幸今天道复转璇，雨露相滋渐觉鲜。\n小椿叶已茂，正欲还覆萱。\n谁知萱花力已尽，一旦萎谢秋风前。\n小椿小椿苦摧折，悠悠此恨何时竭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21155,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊","author":"施元征","text":"我观高士传，如对菊花黄。\n九日闲居惯，三秋古意长。\n晚香酬雨露，傲骨斗风霜。\n甲子义熙后，萧条松径荒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21156,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送之普回乡二首 其一","author":"施元征","text":"静重元公暂养高，泉亭何必学劳劳。\n一天国老希梁栋，五邑门生遍李桃。\n立起百年河内泽，来梳八月广陵涛。\n阳春无不通民隐，卧辙讴歌满乐郊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21157,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送之普回乡二首 其二","author":"施元征","text":"三公出入本康侯，不必台星任去留。\n化雨甘棠原有颂，春晖寸草未能酬。\n昆源本铎欣重振，腐史金华庆再修。\n竹马儿童徒解事，彩云天远更含愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21158,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹炉三首 其一","author":"盛颙","text":"唐相何劳递惠泉，携来随处可茶煎。\n三湘漫卷瓷瓶里，一窍初分太极前。\n吟苦诗瓢和月饮，梦醒书榻带云眠。\n何当再读灵仙赋，千古清风道味全。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21159,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹炉三首 其二","author":"盛颙","text":"一片龙团一勺泉，石分新火趁炉煎。\n绿云擘破先春后，玉杵敲残午夜前。\n仙液尝来欲飞越，寒涛听处不成眠。\n这回唤醒闲风月，可卜归田乐事全。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21160,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹炉三首 其三","author":"盛颙","text":"我爱乡山入品泉，持归禅榻和云煎。\n湘皋卷雪来窗外，蒙顶惊雷落槛前。\n浇破诗愁和得句，洗清尘思意忘荃。\n人间肉食纷如雨，争识吾家此味全。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":21161,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]